me could be said  anywhere in ukraine moscow says it  struck more than 1200 targets overnight  here in kiev the air raid sirens have  been sounding with vladimir putin out to  prove that even if his invasion is now  concentrated on the east nowhere in  ukraine is safe gail  that's hard to hear thank you very much  chris livesay reporting from ukraine
 

